{"_id":"6a2ff9a62204ffbc59e5a7a5","roadmapSlug":"python-data-analysis","nodeId":"5HEYmbVJ6Z7lvgqalVjxW","description":"# Plot Categories\n\nMatplotlib supports a wide range of plot types: line plots (`plot`), bar charts (`bar`, `barh`), scatter plots (`scatter`), histograms (`hist`), box plots (`boxplot`), pie charts (`pie`), and more. Choosing the right plot type depends on the data structure and the relationship being communicated.","resources":[{"type":"official","title":"Plot types","url":"https://matplotlib.org/stable/plot_types/index.html","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aebf5"},{"type":"article","title":"Python Gallery: Matplotlib","url":"https://python-graph-gallery.com/matplotlib/","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aebf6"},{"type":"article","title":"Matplotlib: Part 3. Exploring Different Plot Types","url":"https://medium.com/@ebimsv/mastering-matplotlib-3-exploring-different-plot-types-bd13d18ff613","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aebf7"}],"createdAt":"2026-06-15T13:09:58.430Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-07T12:44:22.099Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a5e3360acf8c05faf5e1c2a","title":"DataCamp - Data Analyst with Python","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/QY0dY9"},{"_id":"6a5e3365acf8c05faf5e1ded","title":"DataCamp - Python Data Fundamentals","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/k4V24x"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/python-data-analysis/content/5HEYmbVJ6Z7lvgqalVjxW.md"}